    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "TWIST",
      "narration_text": "Because accuracy isn't the whole job. A model that's right sixty percent of the time while claiming eighty-five percent confidence is miscalibrated. In triage, in lending, in any real decision, that gap is the dangerous part.",
